/**
 * A full image gallery. Behavioural fix (confirmed against the Jira AC and live Figma Default/
 * Hover instances): this isolated Media-only story has no wrapping `ZimmProductCard` organism to
 * hover, and the desktop prev/next arrows' hover/focus-within reveal now lives entirely on that
 * organism's own root recipe (`zimmProductCard.css.ts` docblock point 6) — so on a hover-capable/
 * desktop browser this story renders the arrows into the DOM, but they are never visible here.
 * See `Commerce/ZimmProductCard`'s own stories for the actual reveal-on-hover demonstration. The
 * touch slide indicator is unaffected by this fix — it still renders and is visible on any
 * non-hover-capable pointer; native scroll-snap paging works on every pointer type regardless.
 *
 * Unlike this file's other mobile-specific behaviours (bag/price mobile swaps, gated by a real
 * `min-width` viewport query), this split is gated by *pointer capability*
