    {
      "items": [
        {
          "field": "description",
          "fieldtype": "jira",
          "from_string": "*As a* Developer, \n\n*I want* Einstein Recommendations provisioned in Business Manager and recommendation zones created for each required surface, \n\n*so that* the PWA carousel components have a valid zone to connect to when built.\n\n----\n\nThis story covers provisioning only: enabling Einstein Recommendations in BM and creating named recommendation zones for Recommended for You (PDP, Cart, Mini-Bag, My Account) and More from Category (PDP). It does not include configuration of recommendation logic, rules-based fallback, or AI/rules toggling — Zimmermann will configure those post-handover. Complete the Look and Shop the Edit are manually merchandised and are not covered here.",
          "to_string": "*As a* Developer, \n\n*I want* Einstein Recommendations provisioned in Business Manager and recommendation zones created for each required surface, \n\n*so that* the PWA carousel components have a valid zone to connect to when built.\n\n----\n\nThis story covers provisioning only: enabling Einstein Recommendations in BM and creating named recommendation zones for Recommended for You (PDP, Cart, Mini-Bag, My Account, Search) and More from Category (PDP). It does not include configuration of recommendation logic, rules-based fallback, or AI/rules toggling — Zimmermann will configure those post-handover. Complete the Look and Shop the Edit are manually merchandised and are not covered here."
        }
      ],
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Bianca Morley",
