122	// ZimmIcon (used by ZimmProductCardContent's bag button) and the icons barrel (used by
123	// ZimmProductCardMedia's close/arrow buttons): known Vitest SVG side-effect issue documented in
124	// .claude/rules/testing.md's "Known gap: ZimmIcon throws under Vitest". Mocked at the same
125	// resolved module each consumer imports — both consumers sit at the same depth below `ui-kits/`
126	// as this test file, so the relative specifiers are identical to what
