135	/**
136	 * Fix I (SFCC-236, click-passthrough): only `useHistory` is overridden — `MemoryRouter`/`Link`
137	 * stay the real v5.3.4 implementations (spread from `actual`), so the existing "exactly one real
138	 * anchor" / name-link tests elsewhere in this file are unaffected. No existing precedent for
139	 * mocking `useHistory` anywhere in this codebase (footer/index.test.tsx,
